      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/octo-org/harness-demo-repo/contents/README.md?ref=4f1e2d3c9b8a7f6e5d4c3b2a1f0e9d8c7b6a5f4e",
      "patch": "@@ -41,7 +41,9 @@ Prices are integers in minor units (cents).\n \n ## Formatting\n \n-`format_price(1234567)` renders `12,345.67`.\n+`format_price(1234567)` renders `12\u2009345.67` -- a thin space separates thousands so\n+that rendered totals cannot be mistaken for a comma-delimited list in exports.\n+Set `PRICING_SEPARATOR=,` to keep the old behaviour.\n \n ## Discounts\n"
